WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:17.486
The car went up the track.

2
00:00:17.487 --> 00:00:20.645
"We're driving a car!" said Kip.

3
00:00:20.646 --> 00:00:24.595
"I don't think I like this," said Bird.

4
00:00:24.596 --> 00:00:27.148
The car went higher.

5
00:00:27.149 --> 00:00:32.890
Then Bird smiled.

6
00:00:32.891 --> 00:00:39.656
"Wow! Look at the ocean, Kip," said Bird.

7
00:00:39.657 --> 00:00:42.468
"And look at those buildings!"

8
00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:44.837
But Kip was not looking.

9
00:00:44.838 --> 00:00:47.027
Kip was covering his eyes.

10
00:00:47.028 --> 00:00:57.912
"I don't think I like this," he said.

11
00:00:57.913 --> 00:01:00.624
Now the car went down fast.

12
00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:04.158
"Whee!" said Bird.

13
00:01:04.159 --> 00:01:07.073
"Ah!" cried Kip.

14
00:01:07.074 --> 00:01:09.663
The car made sharp turns.

15
00:01:09.664 --> 00:01:13.277
It went up and down and up and down.

16
00:01:13.278 --> 00:01:15.413
It went very fast.

17
00:01:15.414 --> 00:01:18.822
"This is fun!" said Bird.

18
00:01:18.823 --> 00:01:26.503
"This is not fun!" cried Kip.

19
00:01:26.504 --> 00:01:30.459
Finally the car stopped.

20
00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:33.625
Kip jumped out.

21
00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:38.637
"That was just like flying!" said Bird.

22
00:01:38.638 --> 00:01:44.446
"I'm glad you had fun, Bird," said Kip.

23
00:01:44.447 --> 00:01:51.166
"But I'm never driving a car again!

24
00:01:51.167 --> 00:02:12.257
Now let's go home and fix your nest."
